      "id": "seg.next-two-weeks.title",
      "criterion": "equivalence",
      "problem": "The English says shower. 洗澡 is the general word for bathing and can mean a tub bath. Post-op wound instructions in Chinese separate 淋浴 (shower) from 盆浴 (tub bath), and this guide's own instruction (wc.08) uses 淋浴. The title makes the permission broader than the English.",
